@Backend_Movies_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Checks
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Database Health Check
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/health/db
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Hero Movie
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/movies/hero
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Movies Catalog (Paginated)
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/movies?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search Movies
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/movies/search?query=Batman
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get All Genres
GET {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/genres
Accept: application/json

### 7. Auth Login (Admin Demo)
POST {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@movies.com",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

### 8. Auth Register
POST {{Backend_Movies_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!"
}
